  m_Name: MainMenuRoutePanel_Settings
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _route: 3
  _title: Settings
  _subtitle: Controller-first configuration
  _summary: Adjust audio, graphics, controls and accessibility from the same Main Menu flow without entering an active Run.
  _detailLines:
  - Audio categories stay separated for Music, SFX and UI cues.
  - Controls include bindings, deadzones and assist-oriented tuning hooks.
  - Graphics stays aligned to the 2D URP presentation and safe presets.
  - Accessibility keeps readability and comfort visible without hidden side menus.
  _footerHint: Confirm or Cancel returns to the Main Menu.